WEBVTT

00:16.680 --> 00:20.280
<b>Your eyes that look far off
into the distance</b>

00:20.280 --> 00:23.950
<b>They're listening to the voice
within your heart</b>

00:23.950 --> 00:28.120
<b>Embracing a moon still blue</b>

00:31.160 --> 00:34.830
<b>Your strength to keep on running</b>

00:34.830 --> 00:38.470
<b>Will open another new door for you</b>

00:38.470 --> 00:42.670
<b>Illuminate the night that
dawns too soon</b>

00:45.670 --> 00:53.050
<b>Even alone, I want to keep on
believing in you</b>

00:53.050 --> 01:00.290
<b>It's in such a moment that
this world will begin to stir</b>

01:00.290 --> 01:03.930
<b>What should we be searching for?</b>

01:03.930 --> 01:07.560
<b>Send out your soul</b>

01:07.560 --> 01:14.330
<b>We'll meet here again someday
if that's the truth</b>

01:14.700 --> 01:18.410
<b>Upon what should we fix our gaze?</b>

01:18.410 --> 01:25.210
<b>The reality that I reached out
and grabbed with my hand</b>

01:25.210 --> 01:28.880
<b>Let it go, let's believe in it</b>

01:32.120 --> 01:35.090
<b>Man, it's definitely gonna
rain at this rate.</b>

01:35.090 --> 01:37.460
<b>I wonder if we'll find an inn
or something in time?</b>

01:37.460 --> 01:40.700
<b>Wanna bet? I've got 1000 yen
that says we won't.</b>

01:40.700 --> 01:41.260
<b>Me too.</b>

01:41.260 --> 01:42.200
<b>Me too, but that isn't much of a bet.
Me too.</b>

01:42.200 --> 01:45.030
<b>Me too, but that isn't much of a bet.</b>

01:46.330 --> 01:48.330
<b>What's wrong, Goku? You
hungry or something?</b>

01:47.450 --> 14:49.820
<b>I take sole responsibility.</b>

01:49.000 --> 01:51.000
<b>No, it's just that...</b>

01:51.810 --> 01:53.780
<b>Something smells weird.</b>

01:53.780 --> 01:55.240
<b>Now that you mention it...</b>

02:03.490 --> 02:05.040
<b>What the hell is this?</b>

02:09.390 --> 02:10.860
<b>Those talismans...</b>

02:26.710 --> 02:28.440
<b>We didn't make it after all.</b>

02:30.250 --> 02:32.550
<b>I've brought some hot tea
for everyone!</b>

02:32.550 --> 02:34.020
<b>Oh, thank you.</b>

02:34.020 --> 02:37.020
<b>It looks like the rain isn't going
to let up for a while.</b>

02:37.020 --> 02:39.020
<b>You've got to be kidding me.</b>

02:39.020 --> 02:42.560
<b>On the way here, we saw
some demon corpses.</b>

02:42.560 --> 02:45.260
<b>Oh, that must be Master
Rikudo's handiwork.</b>

02:45.260 --> 02:46.260
<b>Rikudo?</b>

02:46.260 --> 02:46.760
<b>Who's that?
Rikudo?</b>

02:46.760 --> 02:48.030
<b>Who's that?</b>

02:48.030 --> 02:51.770
<b>You probably don't know him
because you're from the East,</b>

02:51.770 --> 02:56.170
<b>but he's a monk who's lately become
known as our savior around here.</b>

02:56.170 --> 03:00.080
<b>He apparently wanders from place
to place, defeating demons.</b>

03:00.080 --> 03:03.010
<b>Few have actually seen him,</b>

03:03.010 --> 03:06.310
<b>but they say he's a big man with
talismans all over his body.</b>

03:06.310 --> 03:09.480
<b>He's supposed to be an incredibly
powerful monk,</b>

03:09.480 --> 03:12.690
<b>whose talismans can destroy
any kind of demon out there.</b>

03:12.690 --> 03:18.560
<b>Come to think of it, the demon corpses
we saw also had talismans.</b>

03:21.800 --> 03:23.590
<b>I've seen those talismans before.</b>

03:24.770 --> 03:26.230
<b>That man?</b>

03:28.400 --> 03:30.840
<b>No, it can't be.</b>

03:30.840 --> 03:33.480
<b>Wow, so you work and live here?</b>

03:33.480 --> 03:35.140
<b>Where's your room? Tell me.</b>

03:35.140 --> 03:37.080
<b>Oh, what should I do?</b>

03:37.080 --> 03:40.350
<b>It's raining outside,
so let's get wet too.</b>

03:40.350 --> 03:41.820
<b>Oh, you.</b>

03:44.550 --> 03:46.320
<b>Hey, sexually-harassing water sprite!</b>

03:46.320 --> 03:50.630
<b>Ow! What the hell? What I do
is none of your business!</b>

03:50.630 --> 03:53.090
<b>Just the other day, I said to keep
independent activities to a minimum</b>

03:53.090 --> 03:54.600
<b>because of that Kougaiji incident!</b>

03:54.600 --> 03:58.470
<b>Aw, shut up! Where's that paper fan
of yours come from anyway?!</b>

03:58.470 --> 04:03.470
<b>Well, in any case, let's rest here
until the rain lets up.</b>

04:03.470 --> 04:06.100
<b>Hakuryu doesn't have a top after all.</b>

04:09.440 --> 04:10.910
<b>That's right.</b>

04:13.980 --> 04:16.280
<b>Blessed rain it may be,</b>

04:16.280 --> 04:18.910
<b>but it's rather dispiriting when it
continues so, isn't it, Kouryuu?</b>

04:19.620 --> 04:24.080
<b>But it looks like it'll let up by
early evening, Master Sanzo.</b>

04:27.300 --> 04:32.030
<b>Ten years ago,  was still called
by the name of Kouryuu.</b>

04:33.400 --> 04:36.400
<b>Hey, look. It's Kouryuu
the river orphan.</b>

04:36.400 --> 04:39.270
<b>He was cast into the river
as soon as he was born,</b>

04:39.270 --> 04:42.640
<b>and now he acts like he's Master
Sanzo's most favored pupil.</b>

04:42.640 --> 04:45.350
<b>No matter how he excels in martial
arts and spiritual powers,</b>

04:45.350 --> 04:47.080
<b>he's still nothing but a brat.</b>

04:47.080 --> 04:50.820
<b>I guess even Master Sanzo has a
soft spot for a child he raised.</b>

04:50.820 --> 04:52.320
<b>Sheesh, I can hear you guys.</b>

04:52.320 --> 04:56.320
<b>Well, he's more like a page than
a monk in training though.</b>

04:56.320 --> 04:58.290
<b>You got that right.</b>

04:58.290 --> 05:00.830
<b>Owowowowow!</b>

05:00.830 --> 05:05.070
<b>Hey, what're you chitchatting
about while skipping work?</b>

05:05.070 --> 05:05.930
<b>Clerk Abbot!</b>

05:05.930 --> 05:06.570
<b>Clerk Abbot!
If you've got so much extra energy,</b>

05:06.570 --> 05:07.700
<b>If you've got so much extra energy,</b>

05:07.700 --> 05:09.940
<b>maybe I'll leave it up to you guys
to clean the entire compound.</b>

05:09.940 --> 05:12.370
<b>Please excuse us! We'll get back
to our duties right away!</b>

05:13.880 --> 05:16.110
<b>You haven't changed, Shuei.</b>

05:17.010 --> 05:18.910
<b>Neither have you, Kouryuu.</b>

05:20.550 --> 05:23.220
<b>Favored pupil of Koumyou Sanzo,
one of the highest-ranking monks,</b>

05:23.220 --> 05:26.620
<b>and a little prodigy capable
of routing a full-grown man.</b>

05:27.620 --> 05:30.890
<b>They're just too weak,
like the scum they are.</b>

05:30.890 --> 05:32.690
<b>And that attitude to top it all off.</b>

05:32.690 --> 05:34.560
<b>No wonder they're all green with envy.</b>

05:34.560 --> 05:36.550
<b>Well, not like you should
let it bother you.</b>

05:39.400 --> 05:43.070
<b>Man, I'm so glad I'm the Clerk Abbot.</b>

05:43.070 --> 05:46.940
<b>It gets me excused from being
pitted against you in practice.</b>

05:48.080 --> 05:51.350
<b>Yeah, whatever. Shuei
the talisman user,</b>

05:51.350 --> 05:55.380
<b>from a monk in training to Clerk
Abbot, a real man of talent.</b>

05:55.380 --> 05:59.090
<b>There's not a monk who doesn't know
of your talismanic powers.</b>

05:59.090 --> 06:00.550
<b>Well, thank you very much.</b>

06:02.390 --> 06:05.890
<b>Which reminds me, I heard you're
being bestowed a holy name.</b>

06:05.890 --> 06:08.200
<b>It was Master Sanzo's idea,</b>

06:08.200 --> 06:12.500
<b>since I've had tis joke of an
infant name all this time.</b>

06:12.500 --> 06:15.100
<b>Kouryuu the river orphan?</b>

06:15.100 --> 06:20.180
<b>But a holy name for a guy with no
intention of embracing the faith?</b>

06:20.180 --> 06:23.800
<b>I'm going to devote myself to
Master Sanzo, not the faith.</b>

06:24.910 --> 06:26.380
<b>This is my will.</b>

06:29.220 --> 06:31.990
<b>It's not because Master Sanzo is one
of the highest-ranking monks.</b>

06:31.990 --> 06:35.260
<b>And it's not because he saved
my life by taking me in.</b>

06:35.260 --> 06:37.190
<b>My reasons aren't so petty.</b>

06:37.190 --> 06:40.660
<b>I might not be able to believe in gods,
but I can believe in myself.</b>

06:40.660 --> 06:43.530
<b>Master Sanzo's the only person I'll
ever acknowledge as my master.</b>

06:47.300 --> 06:48.770
<b>How very like you.</b>

06:49.870 --> 06:52.210
<b>Clerk Abbot! So this is where you are!</b>

06:52.210 --> 06:53.040
<b>What's wrong?!</b>

06:53.040 --> 06:53.710
<b>An enormous bear has gotten
inside the compound!
What's wrong?!</b>

06:53.710 --> 06:55.240
<b>An enormous bear has gotten
inside the compound!</b>

06:55.240 --> 06:58.580
<b>Perhaps it's spurred by hunger, but
it's rampaging and uncontrollable!</b>

07:04.990 --> 07:06.690
<b>The eyes! Aim for the eyes!</b>

07:06.690 --> 07:08.420
<b>Stop! Get back! Get back from there!</b>

07:13.030 --> 07:13.800
<b>Is he all right?!</b>

07:13.800 --> 07:14.530
<b>It's no good! The spears are
useless against it!
Is he all right?!</b>

07:14.530 --> 07:16.050
<b>It's no good! The spears are
useless against it!</b>

07:16.700 --> 07:18.400
<b>Damn it! I'll seal its mobility!</b>

07:22.470 --> 07:23.940
<b>Kouryuu?</b>

07:26.040 --> 07:28.030
<b>Sorry, but let me do this.</b>

07:35.780 --> 07:38.650
<b>Be gone. There's no food for you here.</b>

07:46.790 --> 07:49.520
<b>A compact for those of us
who coexist in this land.</b>

07:50.870 --> 07:55.070
<b>We will vow never to
disturb your territory,</b>

07:55.070 --> 07:58.610
<b>but at the same time, our domain
is also inviolate.</b>

07:58.610 --> 08:00.480
<b>Do you understand?</b>

08:00.480 --> 08:01.940
<b>Let's make this promise.</b>

08:11.120 --> 08:13.820
<b>What a brat! That intensity!</b>

08:13.820 --> 08:18.230
<b>But that look in his eyes is more like
that of a Shura or a Rasetsu!</b>

08:18.230 --> 08:21.030
<b>What's the matter, Master Sanzo?</b>

08:21.030 --> 08:23.090
<b>No, it's nothing.</b>

08:26.030 --> 08:27.770
<b>I'm coming in, Kouryu.</b>

08:27.770 --> 08:31.170
<b>Master Sanzo wants you to come to
his room for an important talk.</b>

08:40.350 --> 08:42.610
<b>Sorry, I was spaced out. What is it?</b>

08:43.350 --> 08:46.010
<b>Oh, no, Master Sanzo's calling for you.</b>

08:47.820 --> 08:49.290
<b>All right.</b>

08:50.760 --> 08:52.530
<b>Kouryuu...</b>

08:52.530 --> 08:56.060
<b>Someone said you were like
a Shura or a Rasetsu,</b>

08:56.060 --> 08:58.430
<b>but just now, you looked like
something else to me.</b>

08:59.270 --> 09:03.400
<b>Divine hair like spun gold,
deep violet eyes,</b>

09:03.400 --> 09:05.640
<b>haloed in the light of the full moon.</b>

09:05.640 --> 09:06.170
<b>Just like...</b>

09:06.170 --> 09:07.140
<b>Oh, yeah.
Just like...</b>

09:07.140 --> 09:07.740
<b>Oh, yeah.</b>

09:07.740 --> 09:09.570
<b>Here, take it. I want you to have it.</b>

09:10.880 --> 09:15.280
<b>Take it? But this is the one you had
when they found you, right?</b>

09:15.280 --> 09:16.880
<b>You sure about this?</b>

09:16.880 --> 09:18.750
<b>It's all right.</b>

09:18.750 --> 09:23.820
<b>I've never given anyone anything,
so it's a very rare item.</b>

09:30.570 --> 09:32.030
<b>Thank you.</b>

09:34.800 --> 09:37.030
<b>Then the tranquil night
passes quietly...</b>

09:38.940 --> 09:43.580
<b>And the nightmarish morning comes.</b>

09:43.580 --> 09:45.050
<b>Master Sanzo!</b>

09:55.060 --> 09:57.130
<b>How many years has it been</b>

09:57.130 --> 09:59.180
<b>since I last dreamed of
what happened then?</b>

09:59.890 --> 10:01.360
<b>Are you all right?</b>

10:01.360 --> 10:02.830
<b>Hakkai...</b>

10:02.830 --> 10:04.770
<b>You were having a really bad dream.</b>

10:04.770 --> 10:05.670
<b>Sorry...</b>

10:05.670 --> 10:06.270
<b>No, the truth is I don't deal well
with rainy nights either.
Sorry...</b>

10:06.270 --> 10:10.340
<b>No, the truth is I don't deal well
with rainy nights either.</b>

10:10.340 --> 10:11.810
<b>Oh, that's right.</b>

10:13.210 --> 10:16.180
<b>I see. So it's because of the rain?</b>

10:16.180 --> 10:17.640
<b>No!</b>

10:18.450 --> 10:19.910
<b>It came from the kitchen! Let's go!</b>

10:21.450 --> 10:22.850
<b>Help!</b>

10:22.850 --> 10:23.520
<b>What's wrong?!</b>

10:23.520 --> 10:24.990
<b>A demon...</b>

10:35.560 --> 10:37.400
<b>You bastard!</b>

10:37.400 --> 10:41.670
<b>Te kitchen isn't for doing
things like that!</b>

10:41.670 --> 10:43.140
<b>Goku, behind you too!</b>

10:45.170 --> 10:46.640
<b>Take this!</b>

10:49.980 --> 10:52.910
<b>Hey, you sure woke up
fast today, Goku.</b>

10:52.910 --> 10:54.620
<b>I have my days.</b>

10:54.620 --> 10:56.880
<b>Now, what'll we do with these guys?</b>

11:00.990 --> 11:01.520
<b>On!</b>

11:01.520 --> 11:02.450
<b>On!</b>

11:04.390 --> 11:05.860
<b>What the hell?</b>

11:08.460 --> 11:10.160
<b>That voice!</b>

11:13.600 --> 11:15.070
<b>My name is Rikudo.</b>

11:15.870 --> 11:19.100
<b>I'll destroy every last demon
on the face of this Earth.</b>

11:20.410 --> 11:21.970
<b>Those prayer beads and that face!</b>

11:22.980 --> 11:25.000
<b>There's no mistake! Shuei!</b>

11:38.090 --> 11:40.360
<b>Thank you so much, Master Rikudo!</b>

11:40.360 --> 11:42.960
<b>I require no thanks.
This is my mission.</b>

11:44.070 --> 11:45.530
<b>So this guy's Rikudo?</b>

11:48.700 --> 11:51.100
<b>Rikudo's undoubtedly Shuei.</b>

11:52.340 --> 11:55.330
<b>But what's with this evil aura?</b>

11:56.010 --> 11:57.710
<b>He's become a totally different person.</b>

11:58.550 --> 12:01.720
<b>But I guess we lucked out since
he took care of it for us.</b>

12:01.720 --> 12:03.620
<b>Let's sleep, let's sleep!</b>

12:03.620 --> 12:05.490
<b>Hey...</b>

12:05.490 --> 12:07.010
<b>Are you all humans?</b>

12:07.820 --> 12:08.720
<b>What?</b>

12:08.720 --> 12:09.320
<b>What an incredibly rude
question to ask.
What?</b>

12:09.320 --> 12:11.480
<b>What an incredibly rude
question to ask.</b>

12:12.160 --> 12:16.230
<b>You can't fool me! You three
are all demons!</b>

12:16.230 --> 12:18.060
<b>So what if we are?!</b>

12:18.900 --> 12:20.800
<b>Goku!</b>

12:20.800 --> 12:25.340
<b>I told you, didn't I?! That I would
destroy ALL demons!</b>

12:25.340 --> 12:28.440
<b>What's with this guy? He could at
least hear what we have to say.</b>

12:28.440 --> 12:29.910
<b>On!</b>

12:36.080 --> 12:37.550
<b>Shoot!</b>

12:40.860 --> 12:42.320
<b>Shuei...</b>

12:43.590 --> 12:45.890
<b>What the hell are you doing?</b>

12:49.500 --> 12:51.430
<b>You're...</b>

12:51.430 --> 12:53.630
<b>You should know that even
if you kill these guys,</b>

12:53.630 --> 12:55.400
<b></b>

12:55.400 --> 12:57.030
<b>You know him?!</b>

13:02.310 --> 13:04.980
<b>I see. I'd heard the stories,</b>

13:04.980 --> 13:07.310
<b>but I never thought I'd meet up
with you in a place like this!</b>

13:08.220 --> 13:11.550
<b>They say there's a recalcitrant among
the current Sanzo Priests.</b>

13:11.550 --> 13:16.390
<b>That he has chosen boorish
subordinates to journey west with.</b>

13:16.390 --> 13:19.130
<b>Kouryuu! Or I should say,
Genjo Sanzo!</b>

13:19.130 --> 13:21.030
<b>Have you forgotten it was
these very demons</b>

13:21.030 --> 13:24.370
<b>who took the life of your
predecessor?!</b>

13:24.370 --> 13:27.030
<b>How people change, Shuei.</b>

13:27.030 --> 13:30.340
<b>I never thought I'd hear such
words from your mouth.</b>

13:30.340 --> 13:32.010
<b>He didn't change!</b>

13:32.010 --> 13:36.440
<b>Shuei died the day you left
the temple ten years ago!</b>

13:39.450 --> 13:40.910
<b>Let me through!</b>

13:43.520 --> 13:44.990
<b>Priest Koumyou Sanzo!</b>

13:46.050 --> 13:48.020
<b>Kouryuu!</b>

13:48.020 --> 13:49.490
<b>Hey, get a hold of yourself!</b>

13:50.190 --> 13:50.420
<b>I...</b>

13:50.420 --> 13:51.690
<b>What?!
I...</b>

13:51.690 --> 13:51.920
<b>What?!</b>

13:55.530 --> 13:57.000
<b>...couldn't protect him.</b>

14:03.640 --> 14:05.110
<b>I see.</b>

14:05.110 --> 14:09.280
<b>So burglars broke into Master
Sanzo's room last night,</b>

14:09.280 --> 14:13.680
<b>murdered Master Sanzo, and
stole the Seiten Scripture.</b>

14:13.680 --> 14:15.150
<b>Is this what you're saying?</b>

14:15.720 --> 14:17.650
<b>Yes, it is as you say.</b>

14:17.650 --> 14:22.780
<b>The Maten Scripture is safe for my
master guarded it with his life.</b>

14:23.690 --> 14:27.760
<b>Based on their looks, the thieves
were almost certainly demons.</b>

14:27.760 --> 14:30.430
<b>You think we'll believe
a story like that?!</b>

14:30.430 --> 14:32.470
<b>This brat must've killed Master Sanzo!</b>

14:32.470 --> 14:35.370
<b>And you probably hid the Seiten
Scripture somewhere too!</b>

14:35.370 --> 14:37.140
<b>You're nothing but a monster after all!</b>

14:37.140 --> 14:38.910
<b>You bastard! What basis do you have?!</b>

14:38.910 --> 14:40.370
<b>It's all right, Shuei.</b>

14:41.310 --> 14:43.310
<b>Not only was my master killed,</b>

14:43.310 --> 14:47.450
<b>but one of the temple's sacred relics,
the Scripture, was stolen.</b>

14:49.820 --> 14:53.510
<b>Abbott, please grant me permission
to leave the temple.</b>

14:54.290 --> 14:57.120
<b>I shall avenge my master and
take back the Seiten Scripture</b>

14:57.120 --> 14:58.920
<b>even if it should cost me my life.</b>

14:59.630 --> 15:02.860
<b>You better not be trying to smooth
talk your way out of this!</b>

15:06.030 --> 15:09.270
<b>But, Kouryuu, avenging your
master is one thing.</b>

15:09.270 --> 15:11.170
<b>The fact the Scripture was lost</b>

15:11.170 --> 15:14.310
<b>is the responsibility of everyone
here at Kinzan Temple.</b>

15:14.310 --> 15:17.140
<b>Surely, it's not a crime you alone
should be burdened with.</b>

15:17.140 --> 15:21.820
<b>You're wrong. I intend to go in search
of what belongs to me.</b>

15:21.820 --> 15:22.950
<b>What?</b>

15:22.950 --> 15:23.320
<b>Last night, I received a summons
from my master,
What?</b>

15:23.320 --> 15:26.020
<b>Last night, I received a summons
from my master,</b>

15:26.020 --> 15:29.050
<b>and I was bestowed a formal holy
name right before he passed away.</b>

15:31.260 --> 15:35.630
<b>Genjo Sanzo, that's my name
from this day forth!</b>

15:35.630 --> 15:37.060
<b>That chakra on your forehead!</b>

15:37.870 --> 15:40.740
<b>The crimson chakra passed down
from Sanzo to Sanzo</b>

15:40.740 --> 15:42.670
<b>is the mark of one chosen by Heaven,</b>

15:42.670 --> 15:45.100
<b>a mark of one close to the gods.</b>

15:47.140 --> 15:49.380
<b>So that's the will of the Lord Buddha?</b>

15:49.380 --> 15:50.650
<b>Abbott!</b>

15:50.650 --> 15:50.880
<b>This was Koumyou Sanzo's
gold coronet.
Abbott!</b>

15:50.880 --> 15:54.050
<b>This was Koumyou Sanzo's
gold coronet.</b>

15:54.050 --> 15:59.320
<b>I hereby recognize you as Priest Toua
Genjo Sanzo the 31st,</b>

15:59.320 --> 16:02.620
<b>formal heir to the Seiten
and Maten Scriptures,</b>

16:02.620 --> 16:07.290
<b>two of the five Founding Scriptures
of Heaven and Earth.</b>

16:08.400 --> 16:12.090
<b>That night, you secretly descended
the mountain, but...</b>

16:14.040 --> 16:17.640
<b>Right after that, the demon burglars
launched another attack,</b>

16:17.640 --> 16:20.610
<b>trying to get the Maten Scripture
they had failed to seize before,</b>

16:20.610 --> 16:23.240
<b>not knowing you had
already left with it.</b>

16:24.680 --> 16:27.010
<b>All the powerful monks in the temple
pooled their resources,</b>

16:27.010 --> 16:28.620
<b>but they didn't stand a chance.</b>

16:28.620 --> 16:30.420
<b>Not surprising really,</b>

16:30.420 --> 16:34.080
<b>since even you and Master Sanzo
couldn't stand up to them.</b>

16:34.920 --> 16:39.430
<b>So I cast a curse upon myself
using a forbidden talisman.</b>

16:39.430 --> 16:42.520
<b>Grant me the power to
destroy all demons!</b>

16:43.430 --> 16:46.070
<b>You didn't use the Spell of Araya?!</b>

16:46.070 --> 16:51.710
<b>I did! Thus, I obtained great holy
power and defeated the demons.</b>

16:51.710 --> 16:53.170
<b>However...</b>

16:57.280 --> 17:00.510
<b>Once released, its power
can't be suppressed.</b>

17:00.510 --> 17:02.180
<b>My body is now nothing more</b>

17:02.180 --> 17:06.450
<b>than a means for it to continue
devouring the souls of demons!</b>

17:06.450 --> 17:09.620
<b>Damn it, that thing's completely
embedded in him.</b>

17:10.860 --> 17:15.760
<b>For the last ten years, I've endlessly
murdered innocent demons</b>

17:15.760 --> 17:20.070
<b>to escape this talisman and the
excruciating pain it inflicts!</b>

17:20.070 --> 17:24.040
<b>But now that the demons have
begun to attack humans,</b>

17:24.040 --> 17:26.730
<b>people revere even someone
like me as a savior!</b>

17:29.980 --> 17:31.440
<b>Isn't that hilarious?!</b>

17:33.180 --> 17:34.810
<b>This guy has totally lost it.</b>

17:35.580 --> 17:37.210
<b>Who the heck is the demon here?</b>

17:38.920 --> 17:41.290
<b>Shuei, you are now...</b>

17:42.120 --> 17:45.360
<b>...just a soul-hungry monster
possessed by the talisman.</b>

17:45.360 --> 17:48.730
<b>Why don't we see who
IS the demon here?</b>

17:48.730 --> 17:50.460
<b>Outside, it's too dangerous here.</b>

17:50.460 --> 17:52.000
<b>We gotta get wet again?!</b>

17:52.000 --> 17:53.470
<b>Better than being killed in here.</b>

17:54.970 --> 17:56.370
<b>Man, this rain sucks!</b>

17:56.370 --> 17:57.800
<b>Visibility is bad.</b>

17:58.710 --> 18:00.500
<b>Hakkai, behind you!</b>

18:07.280 --> 18:10.890
<b>My body has been completely
assimilated by the talisman.</b>

18:10.890 --> 18:12.850
<b>You guys won't even be able
to stand to touch me!</b>

18:13.620 --> 18:15.450
<b>Let him go, you bastard!</b>

18:17.530 --> 18:18.990
<b>The footing's awful!</b>

18:20.860 --> 18:22.500
<b>Sanzo, no fair!</b>

18:22.500 --> 18:24.470
<b>What's the matter, Genjo Sanzo?</b>

18:24.470 --> 18:26.670
<b>Do you not lend your help
to demons after all?</b>

18:26.670 --> 18:30.670
<b>Naw, it's just that, whether
I help them or not,</b>

18:30.670 --> 18:33.140
<b>theseguys won't die anyway.</b>

18:33.140 --> 18:34.640
<b>Well, that's true enough.</b>

18:34.640 --> 18:38.110
<b>And he probably wouldn't pray for
our souls even if we did die.</b>

18:38.110 --> 18:40.080
<b>Ridiculous!</b>

18:40.080 --> 18:42.910
<b>These guys are great.</b>

18:45.190 --> 18:49.180
<b>Master, what're you doing,
skipping lecture?</b>

18:51.290 --> 18:53.520
<b>I'm making paper airplanes.</b>

18:54.730 --> 18:57.390
<b>I've little in the way of teachings
worth imparting to others.</b>

18:58.100 --> 19:00.230
<b>About all I know</b>

19:00.230 --> 19:02.130
<b>is how to fold paper airplanes.</b>

19:06.510 --> 19:08.240
<b>Isn't it beautiful?</b>

19:08.240 --> 19:10.680
<b>The blue sky highlights the orange,</b>

19:10.680 --> 19:13.310
<b>and the orange makes the blue
look even more beautiful.</b>

19:14.620 --> 19:16.820
<b>They enhance each other's
distinctive qualities,</b>

19:16.820 --> 19:18.880
<b>because they're opposites in color.</b>

19:20.450 --> 19:23.420
<b>Well, it's a trifling thing really.</b>

19:24.560 --> 19:25.990
<b>Not at all.</b>

19:27.700 --> 19:29.160
<b>It's beautiful.</b>

19:30.330 --> 19:31.960
<b>There was something
I wanted to protect.</b>

19:33.000 --> 19:36.370
<b>When I lost it, I learned for the
first time how worthless I was.</b>

19:37.770 --> 19:40.640
<b>I learned I had my hands full,
just looking after myself.</b>

19:41.610 --> 19:43.380
<b>And then I wished</b>

19:43.380 --> 19:45.400
<b>to have things I wouldn't
have to protect.</b>

19:46.150 --> 19:48.480
<b>None of our attacks are working!</b>

19:48.480 --> 19:51.090
<b>We can't go near him!
He deflects our spells!</b>

19:51.090 --> 19:52.490
<b>What the hell are we supposed
to do with him?!</b>

19:52.490 --> 19:53.950
<b>What an annoying opponent.</b>

19:54.520 --> 19:55.990
<b>Hey...</b>

19:56.760 --> 19:59.090
<b>Forget about your silly
sense of justice.</b>

19:59.090 --> 20:03.430
<b>There's only one way to release him
from the talisman.</b>

20:03.430 --> 20:05.170
<b>No!</b>

20:05.170 --> 20:06.030
<b>Goku?</b>

20:06.030 --> 20:06.700
<b>He might be like this now, but he
used to be your friend, right?!
Goku?</b>

20:06.700 --> 20:09.900
<b>He might be like this now, but he
used to be your friend, right?!</b>

20:09.900 --> 20:11.370
<b>I mean it! Don't!</b>

20:20.380 --> 20:22.280
<b>You make me sick.</b>

20:26.020 --> 20:28.450
<b>Wait... Snzo...</b>

20:34.860 --> 20:36.000
<b>Sanzo!</b>

20:36.000 --> 20:36.360
<b>Sanzo! Wake up, Sanzo!
Sanzo!</b>

20:36.360 --> 20:38.730
<b>Sanzo! Wake up, Sanzo!</b>

20:38.730 --> 20:41.100
<b>This isn't your style! What
the hell are you doing?!</b>

20:41.100 --> 20:44.870
<b>Shut up...</b>

20:44.870 --> 20:46.440
<b>That's what I want to know.</b>

20:46.440 --> 20:47.870
<b>Sanzo!</b>

20:49.180 --> 20:55.580
<b>That's right, even sudden
tragedies come</b>

20:55.580 --> 21:00.960
<b>Looking good-natured, without
cause for suspicion</b>

21:00.960 --> 21:06.460
<b>Don't complain, just shut up</b>

21:06.460 --> 21:09.860
<b>And look up</b>

21:09.860 --> 21:15.670
<b>I'll stay in character no matter
how ordinary the scene is</b>

21:15.670 --> 21:21.080
<b>Before any talk of dreams or hopes</b>

21:21.080 --> 21:26.410
<b>It's probably the same for everyone</b>

21:26.410 --> 21:30.350
<b>You must fight against yourself</b>

21:37.320 --> 21:41.000
<b>The sun sets and a new day comes</b>

21:41.000 --> 21:42.960
<b>Repeating is one change</b>

21:42.960 --> 21:47.070
<b>Don't avert eyes from differences</b>

21:47.070 --> 21:51.210
<b>Your nerve and soul to the limit</b>

21:51.210 --> 21:53.870
<b>Go forward now</b>

21:53.870 --> 21:58.950
<b>Standing next to the taut pressure</b>

21:58.950 --> 22:04.350
<b>I'll laugh more boldly and
fearlessly than anyone</b>

22:04.350 --> 22:09.760
<b>It's probably the same for everyone</b>

22:09.760 --> 22:13.820
<b>You must fight against yourself</b>

22:23.870 --> 22:25.360
<b>Next Saiyuki</b>

22:26.670 --> 22:29.080
<b>Rain</b>

22:29.080 --> 22:29.640
<b>Rain
Sanzo, what's wrong with you?!</b>

22:29.640 --> 22:30.680
<b>Sanzo, what's wrong with you?!</b>

22:30.680 --> 22:32.010
<b>Friend
Sanzo, what's wrong with you?!</b>

22:32.010 --> 22:33.600
<b>Friend</b>

22:34.050 --> 22:35.680
<b>Sanzo!</b>

22:35.680 --> 22:36.650
<b>Hatred</b>

22:36.650 --> 22:38.390
<b>Hatred
Hey, please wake up!</b>

22:38.390 --> 22:38.610
<b>Hatred</b>

22:40.590 --> 22:42.050
<b>Sanzo!</b>

22:43.520 --> 22:44.990
<b>Sanzo!</b>

22:45.590 --> 22:46.730
<b>And then...</b>

22:46.730 --> 22:48.230
<b>And then...
Sanzo!</b>

22:48.230 --> 22:48.960
<b>And then...</b>

22:49.430 --> 22:49.530
<b>Next Time
A Twilight Farewell</b>

22:49.530 --> 22:51.400
<b>Next Time
A Twilight Farewell
Sanzo!</b>

22:51.400 --> 22:53.330
<b>Next Time
A Twilight Farewell</b>
